{"root":"hati","ipa":"/ha.ti/","core":"指人体内的器官“肝脏”，在印尼语中也常引申为“心”、“内心”或“情绪”的中心，用于表达情感、意图或良知。","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ha.ti/","zh":"肝脏；心；内心","phrases":[{"t":"sakit hati","zh":"伤心；怀恨在心"},{"t":"buah hati","zh":"心肝宝贝；爱人"},{"t":"rendah hati","zh":"谦虚"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia selalu menjaga kebersihan hatinya.","zh":"他总是保持内心的纯洁。"},{"t":"Hati saya merasa tenang setelah mendengar kabar itu.","zh":"听到那个消息后，我的心感到平静。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"hati","ipa":"/ha.ti/","zh":"肝脏；心","phrase":{"t":"hati-hati","zh":"小心；谨慎"},"example":{"t":"Hati-hati saat menyeberang jalan.","zh":"过马路时要小心。"}},{"w":"berhati-hati","ipa":"/bər.ha.ti.ha.ti/","zh":"小心翼翼地；谨慎地","phrase":{"t":"berhati-hati dalam bertindak","zh":"行事谨慎"},"example":{"t":"Kita harus berhati-hati dalam mengambil keputusan.","zh":"我们在做决定时必须谨慎。"}},{"w":"perhatian","ipa":"/pər.ha.ti.an/","zh":"注意；关心；关注","phrase":{"t":"menarik perhatian","zh":"吸引注意力"},"example":{"t":"Terima kasih atas perhatian Anda.","zh":"感谢您的关注。"}},{"w":"memperhatikan","ipa":"/məm.pər.ha.ti.kan/","zh":"注意；观察；留意","phrase":{"t":"memperhatikan keadaan","zh":"留意情况"},"example":{"t":"Guru memperhatikan murid-muridnya dengan saksama.","zh":"老师仔细地观察着学生们。"}}],"derSlugs":["hati","berhati-hati","perhatian","memperhatikan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-25T09:32:33.439Z","src":"base"}